      "cliffhanger": "Juliana defiantly declares she chose a man who stood by her when her fiancé walked away, leaving the villains speechless.",
      "why": "Captures the core conflict of class betrayal and female resilience, ending on a powerful emotional stand that hooks viewers to see the consequences.",
      "context_gap": "Strangers won't know why Gerald abandoned her or who the 'scarred beggar' is without prior context."
